WEBVTT

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:17.000
Tencent Video presents

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:29.920
Adapted from the bestseller The King's Avatar
by Butterfly Blue

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:32.270
Copyright Notice
All rights preserved by China Literature

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:49.580
Done.

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:52.250
Hard training for nearly half a month.

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:53.120
Finally.

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:55.330
Ye Qiu.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:57.040
Just wait and see.

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:58.910
You are about to be history.

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:27.850
♪ The dawn piercing horn is being played by now ♪

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:30.970
♪ Is that a fantasy or just past memories? ♪

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:35.520
♪ Eyes wide open, but I can't tell ♪

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:39.470
♪ which side of the road am I running on ♪

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:46.850
♪ Would I know the memories and breaks mixed in morning light? ♪

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:50.220
♪ They said you shouldn't march on ♪

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:52.720
♪ They said you have to say goodbye ♪

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:57.220
♪ They say you can have no tomorrow but dark night ♪

00:01:57.470 --> 00:01:59.850
♪ Over the finish line ♪

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:02.350
♪ I will restart my dream again ♪

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:04.140
♪ Even if it's dangerous ♪

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:09.350
♪ I will keep marching and get my crown back ♪

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:12.770
♪ Put on my armor and step to the unknown future ♪

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:17.930
♪ Hold on to my light on the road together with you ♪

00:02:17.930 --> 00:02:19.020
♪ becomes the power that supports me ♪

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:22.600
♪ The morning light that burns in my heart ♪

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:24.970
♪ will blossom at dawn ♪

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:27.680
♪ Dawn of Glory on battlefield ♪

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:30.930
♪ I will show you my edge ♪

00:02:32.970 --> 00:02:39.140
<b>Bad Example</b>

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:45.060
(Level 55, Leveling Area - Chalk Town)

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:52.200
You can't go anywhere.

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:54.000
Stop fighting.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.040
It's not going to work.

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:05.560
Shadow Dance

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:06.290
It's so painful.

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:07.580
Cleric.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:08.750
Help me.

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:16.160
Captain.

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:20.250
Sorry, I can't hold it.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:20.790
Who is it?

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:22.000
Who's peeping?

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:24.620
Why are you laughing all of a sudden?

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:25.500
Got me exposed.

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:28.410
Princess Golden lying on the ground eating mud.

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:29.500
Isn't it funny?

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:31.120
Sorry.

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:31.950
Sorry for the intrusion.

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:33.120
Lord Grim.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:33.830
Go get him!

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:34.500
What took you so long?

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:35.620
I've been waiting for a long time.

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:36.830
Wait for what?

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:39.250
A chance to scrap-picking.

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:40.540
You want to kill me and get my item!

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:42.700
Don't overthink it.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:44.330
The Gunner is my target.

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:46.540
What's with you and Gunners?

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:48.000
Don't you come near me.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:50.580
You go get him!

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:55.000
My relationship with Gunners are great.

00:03:57.160 --> 00:04:01.370
You're such a bully!

00:04:02.350 --> 00:04:02.500
5% rate of armor
piercing for 6 second.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:04.200
Orange weapon. Hand cannon.

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:04.830
5% rate of armor
piercing for 6 second.

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:05.290
How you like that?

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:06.270
5% rate of armor
piercing for 6 second.

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:07.500
Great, good.

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:08.870
Thank you.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.700
<b>Princess Tulip</b>

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:13.200
Lord Grim is such a bully.

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:15.160
He killed me and robbed my orange weapon.
<b>Princess Tulip</b>

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:16.410
Lord Grim

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:18.000
It is said that he's Ye Qiu.

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:19.370
I don't care who the heck is he.

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:20.700
No one can bully Tulip.

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:22.120
Thank you for helping me.

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:25.250
Besides Lord Grim, there's another guy called Deception.

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:26.160
Deception?

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.540
The scrap-picker?

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:30.290
Yeah, they two.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:32.620
The weapons are still on them.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.910
Please help me to get them back.

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:37.910
Please.

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:40.830
Mr. President.

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:43.120
Please.

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:44.120
Tulip.

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:46.450
I'll send out team to cut down on their range of activities.

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:47.950
Drive them to your direction.

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:50.080
Bring more hands to get them over with.

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:53.370
Thank you, president.

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:58.250
Besides your hand cannon, pay
attention to Lord Grim's own weapon.

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:00.500
If it comes out, make sure you get it.

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:01.700
Don't run.

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:03.120
Stop.

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:05.500
You can't run.

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:06.870
Stop running. Stop.

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:07.370
Don't follow me.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:08.580
You are such a genius.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:09.750
We got a team chasing us at the back.

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:10.450
You are the lead.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:11.450
And you tell me not to follow you?

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.290
Why don't you just stay with the crowd?

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:17.370
We Excellent Dynasty will get you down today.

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:20.700
What did you do to them?

00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:22.160
I have to do my scrap-picking.

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:23.830
What you did is not scrap-picking.

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:25.700
It's called kill and run.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:28.370
All scrap-pickers want to do that.

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:29.700
They just don't have the balls for it.

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:31.410
So they have to take advantages of other's fights.

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:32.200
Right?

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:34.200
Nope.

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:36.620
Scrap-picking is a simple way to get the most items.

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:38.290
It's not the same with kill and run.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.120
But in terms of original purpose,

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:42.620
Scrap-picking aims at the items, same as kill and run.

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:44.700
And it's easier than kill and run.

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:48.790
Compared to this shabby scrap-picking,
why not just go out there and kill all you can?

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:50.370
No.

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:51.410
That is not right.

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:52.950
Of course, it's not right.

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:56.120
Neither kill and run, nor scrap-picking is a good thing.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.040
Then why you have to come up with all this bullshit?
I own this path!

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:02.700
I'm trying to help you realize that
it's OK to do scrap-picking occasionally,

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:05.450
but aiming for it completely like you do?

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:07.160
It's not only less efficient compared to kill and run.

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:08.160
It's also dumb.

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:11.250
I say, you take the time you have
for scrap-picking and use it on PK.

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:18.250
Then what are you doing now?

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:20.160
This is self-defense.

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:20.950
They are trying to kill me.

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:21.830
Then I have to kill them back.

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:23.870
A real man never explains.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:25.500
You?

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:26.700
Why are you still on?

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:28.700
A real man never explains.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.000
Come on.

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:34.160
Kill them all!

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:37.910
Stop.

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:43.600
Landslide

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:54.410
They have help.

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:56.000
Even the guild name is hidden.

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:57.040
Who are they?

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:00.080
What are you doing?

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:08.580
Help!

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:09.500
What?

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:10.950
All 20 of them got aced?

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.120
The other team got seven people.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:14.160
Berserker.

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:15.540
Battle Mage.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.450
Are they the side accounts from Heavenly Sword?

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:18.370
President.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:19.250
What should we do?

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:20.160
Should we send more men?

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:21.910
More man my ass.

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.120
They're the coming pro-players for the next season.

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:26.910
Let's withdraw first.

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:43.000
Liu, Captain Liu.

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:45.580
Ye Qiu is in the game right now.

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:50.410
He is with that Heavenly Sword going all around.

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.910
Aced a whole team with only seven of them.

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:55.160
It's just a team of ordinary players.

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:56.660
I can do it by myself.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:58.580
Of course.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:01.620
I happen to have several accounts on hand.

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:04.700
Do you want to give them a surprise present?

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.000
Sounds interesting.

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:20.750
I think we lost them.

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:22.790
Stay focused.

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:25.160
This one behind is their eyes on us.

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:26.830
There may be more men coming in the back.

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:29.000
There's a team coming.

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:31.290
Only five of them?

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:36.250
(Shen Jian: Striker, Liu Hao: Ghostblade, Sun Xiang: Battle Mage
Zhang Jiaxing: Cleric, He Ming: Elementalist)

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:37.000
Watch out.

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:38.620
I think they're good.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:55.660
Dash Hit.

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:00.910
Falling Palm.

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:12.410
This is impossible.

00:09:15.890 --> 00:09:16.810
Broken Flash

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:40.040
Ye Qiu.

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:42.580
You are going down today.

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:02.290
Rising Dragon Soars the Sky.

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:11.660
Dragon Head Turning.

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:12.410
No.

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:13.250
This angle...

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:15.120
It's the Dragon Raising Its Head.

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:16.620
Are you kidding me?

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:18.000
Who are you?

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:21.580
I am Sun Xiang.

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:31.420
The King's Avatar 2

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:42.120
Sun Xiang?

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:43.680
Is he famous?

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:45.660
You didn't know me?

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:47.620
Why should I?

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:50.450
I don't believe you.

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:54.870
So how do you like this Dragon Raising Its Head?

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:56.750
Very talented.

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:59.160
You didn't master it yet in the All Star Game.

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:00.830
That's right.

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:03.080
But now I'm doing it better than you.

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:03.950
So what?

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:07.250
So what?

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:10.450
Still talking big.

00:11:10.450 --> 00:11:13.790
This means you are now history.

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:20.770
You think making that Dragon Raising Its Head
in the All Star Game

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:22.700
will make you a big shark to everyone?

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:26.120
Now you have been completely replaced.

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:29.290
What else can you do to prove yourself, huh?

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:30.160
Liu Hao.

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:31.450
He Ming.

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:32.410
Shen Jian.

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:33.870
Zhang Jiaxing.

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:36.450
Excellent Era's main players.

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:38.870
You've been through a lot for me.

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:39.910
How may I help you?

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:41.830
Sorry, Captain Ye.

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:44.540
Today we are the mouse and we will eat you elephant.

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:48.580
You do know that mouse can never
eat an elephant in real life, right?

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:52.200
Even if you admit to be the mouse,
you still can't have me as the elephant.

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:56.080
We will find out in a minute who's the real elephant.

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:58.250
Shame on you for calling yourself pros.

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:00.410
You can't even see that we have an absolute chance.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:02.120
We outnumber you.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:06.870
With you?

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:08.410
In your dreams.

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:12.830
V Strike.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:43.370
This dude is good.

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:44.950
He can just block the grenades.

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:46.620
Why did he have to slap it?

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:48.450
That's right.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:50.330
There's no need for that.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:51.870
Too many extra moves.

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:53.200
Got flaws everywhere.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:54.870
Is it?

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:56.580
Well, beat me then.

00:12:57.750 --> 00:12:58.290
Sorry.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:12:59.750
I'm not talking to you.

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:01.450
But thank you.

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:03.500
As a bad example.

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:04.660
You did a great job.

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:06.080
MVP.

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:08.500
You, you!

00:13:21.620 --> 00:13:24.410
I see you studied on Unspecialized.

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:26.660
But I'm not in the professional world anymore.

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:27.750
Another unnecessary move.

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:29.000
Bad example.

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:30.290
You!

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:35.330
Don't you think...

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:36.160
On the ground!

00:13:40.410 --> 00:13:41.750
I'll give you another lesson for free.

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:45.500
Glory is not a one-man game.

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:49.040
You're so low!

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:49.870
Why are you all standing there?

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:54.120
When you get to the Pro League,
you gonna face your rival with that attitude?

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:55.700
Thunder Fire.

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:06.910
Raging Blood.

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:29.410
This kind of fight.is meaningless.

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:31.950
Guys.

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:32.910
Retreat.

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:36.790
Try to leave?

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:44.250
Damn it.

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:45.620
Wait.

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:46.790
They might have an ambush here.

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:47.870
They're all gone!

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:48.830
I'm not waiting!

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:51.370
This must be Ye Qiu's set-up.

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:52.450
He wants us to run into different directions.

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:53.450
So that he can crack us one by one.

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:54.160
He Ming.

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:55.250
You keep up with him.

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:01.000
Come on.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:01.370
Keep up.

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:06.330
Who is it?

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:11.370
Ye Qiu?

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:15.250
How can you be here?

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:17.330
Wait, we got into his trap.

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:18.040
Rescue.

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:19.080
Help!

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:23.330
He Ming!

00:15:25.290 --> 00:15:26.120
Ye Qiu.

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:28.250
You distracted us on purpose.

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:29.750
Thunder Fire.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:41.830
We are surrounded.

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:42.660
What should we do?

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:43.910
Go to the team channel.

00:15:43.910 --> 00:15:44.750
Call Captain Sun back.

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:46.500
Where is the Captain Sun?

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:48.700
Landslide.

00:15:57.750 --> 00:15:58.080
Shen Jian.

00:15:58.450 --> 00:15:59.450
Don't fight with him.

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:00.700
Go for the head first.

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:01.660
I'll be right there.

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:13.750
Sacred Fire.

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:17.200
Thousand Leaves.

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:18.750
Sacred Fire.

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:25.700
Shit.

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:26.620
Move.

00:16:30.450 --> 00:16:31.120
Shen Jian!

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:33.080
Zhang Jiaxing!

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:33.910
Resurrection.

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:35.370
I can't.

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:37.000
Shen Jian is within the range of Sacred Fire.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:37.790
Skills are invalid in that range.

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:44.000
You mean Ye Qiu can predict my use of skills?

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:44.870
We're still fighting.

00:16:45.450 --> 00:16:46.370
Why are you looking all around?

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:02.330
You're the only one left.

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:03.910
Got anything to say?

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:05.870
Where are you?

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:06.910
Come out!

00:17:10.910 --> 00:17:12.660
There you are.

00:17:16.290 --> 00:17:17.330
What took you so long?

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:18.660
We've been waiting for you for a long time.

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:21.120
Ye Qiu!

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:22.580
You are so low.

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:24.750
What's going on here?

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:26.950
The three of us followed them here and got ambushed.

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:27.910
What about you?

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:29.290
What happened?

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:32.500
When He Ming and I came after
them, we got caught in a trap.

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:33.790
We couldn't get out.

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:36.790
It must be that scrap-picker.

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.080
Ye Qiu got us this once.

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:40.410
Come on.

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:41.080
Cut the crap.

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:42.290
Bring it on.

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:49.290
Lou.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:49.910
Cross Slash.

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:55.120
Flame Shock.

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:05.200
Good.

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:06.540
Good team work.

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:08.290
Continue.

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:09.580
Liu Hao.

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:10.540
What are you doing?

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:13.120
I thought you didn't need help.

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:14.160
But go ahead.

00:18:14.620 --> 00:18:15.830
This is a number game.

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:17.120
It's not a shame to call on help.

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:19.250
I can do it myself!

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:28.450
Only a team can come up with
the really impeccable combo hit.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:32.410
Glory is not a one-man game.

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:36.660
Why does his words pop up in my head?

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:37.830
Damn it.

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:40.700
Maybe I should sacrifice myself
to cover up for Captain Sun.

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:42.870
It's a good way to start a friendship.

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:44.580
We lost on this one.

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:45.250
You withdraw first.

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:46.330
We'll hit again, with another team sometimes.

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:47.250
I'll cover you.

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:51.370
No need.

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:52.790
I can do it myself.

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:54.370
Knight's Spirit.

00:18:54.870 --> 00:18:55.790
Great skill.

00:18:56.040 --> 00:18:57.540
Knight, Knight's Spirit.

00:18:57.950 --> 00:18:59.200
Is he got enough combos to do that?

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:02.080
Both AS and AP are improving.

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:04.410
It's hard to trigger this in the professional game.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:08.410
I'm glad I am facing a bunch of losers like you.

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:09.950
Well, should we retreat?

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:11.200
Retreat?

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:15.370
I wonder if you think about it, if you back off,

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:18.160
I can just choose anyone as my target and kill him instantly.

00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:20.830
I can see you're trying to use your tactic brain.

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:23.870
But you still didn't get the story right.

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:26.040
Otherwise, you should have picked me as your target.

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:29.080
Don't you see that I am the core of our team?

00:19:29.450 --> 00:19:30.500
If that's what you want.

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:33.540
Dragon Break the Ranks.

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:39.160
You!

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:40.370
I told you.

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:41.330
We outnumber you.

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:42.580
Absolute advantage.

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:44.250
Seven players vs two.

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:45.450
Do you want to continue?

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:46.450
You.

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:47.620
Ye Qiu.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:49.200
If you are a man, go solo with me.

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:50.830
One on one?

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:52.250
Are you out of your mind?

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:53.250
I'm only level 52.

00:19:54.410 --> 00:19:55.450
Ye Qiu.

00:19:55.950 --> 00:19:57.120
One of us have to die today!

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:02.410
A true advice from me.

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:04.660
Your mind set is not for Glory.

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:05.040
Shit.

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:07.660
Go play Mario Bros or Galaxian.

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:09.250
You will find your game.

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:09.660
You!

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:25.450
He dead?

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:28.950
We, we won!

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:32.750
We are so good!

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:34.750
Deception.

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:36.950
Why are you so keen on picking things?

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:41.910
Do you have to be that mean?

00:20:41.910 --> 00:20:43.410
Mario brothers?

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:45.200
Sun Xiang must be pissed.

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:46.290
I mean it.

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:48.290
Even Contra is not a fit for him.

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:50.080
They got dual play in Contra.

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:54.370
You.

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:55.910
Are you OK?

00:20:58.450 --> 00:20:59.370
I have to go get some air.

00:21:12.900 --> 00:21:15.930
(Excellent Era)

00:21:22.700 --> 00:21:25.660
We have the triple crown!

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:31.580
The team performance has been declining.

00:21:32.160 --> 00:21:33.660
You don't want to be involved in marketing activities.

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:36.540
How am I supposed to keep the sponsors?

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:39.870
Ye Qiu.

00:21:40.370 --> 00:21:43.370
The club has decided to have Sun Xiang who transferred here

00:21:43.370 --> 00:21:44.540
to take over your position as team captain.

00:21:44.910 --> 00:21:47.500
One Autumn Leaf will be owned by Sun Xiang from now on.

00:21:48.330 --> 00:21:49.040
Ye Xiu!

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:51.080
Ye Xiu.

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:53.370
Is that all right?

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:57.500
Sun Xiang is very gifted.

00:21:57.790 --> 00:21:59.660
If he can have good guides from old players,

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:02.790
maybe he'll be the future for Excellent Era.

00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:07.120
Excellent Era is done.

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:12.540
Ye Xiu.

00:22:34.020 --> 00:22:36.810
♪ If you can't see the sky with your head up ♪

00:22:38.220 --> 00:22:41.930
♪ Then look down and focus on where you're heading ♪

00:22:42.180 --> 00:22:46.770
♪ We all know that we don't want to bury our dreams ♪

00:22:46.770 --> 00:22:48.930
♪ Step back for the next take-off ♪

00:22:51.350 --> 00:22:53.560
♪ All channels are reconnected ♪

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:55.520
♪ I remember you said you would wait ♪

00:22:55.770 --> 00:22:57.640
♪ Fine melody under my fingertips ♪

00:22:57.640 --> 00:22:59.810
♪ Perfect performance in digital world ♪

00:23:02.520 --> 00:23:04.520
♪ Brand-new melody, brand-new you and me ♪

00:23:04.560 --> 00:23:07.810
♪ Our passion will support us to the end ♪

00:23:07.810 --> 00:23:11.060
♪ Light the fire in you ♪

00:23:11.060 --> 00:23:13.180
♪ Shine away the weakness in dark ♪

00:23:13.180 --> 00:23:14.890
♪ You can laugh at me, you can look down on me ♪

00:23:14.890 --> 00:23:16.680
♪ They would only drive me further ♪

00:23:16.810 --> 00:23:19.930
♪ Take record of our pulses ♪

00:23:22.060 --> 00:23:23.930
♪ All those provocations ♪

00:23:23.930 --> 00:23:26.100
♪ They will only firm my steps ♪

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:54.790
Rookie.

00:23:55.370 --> 00:23:56.580
Do you know who I am?

00:23:57.080 --> 00:23:59.700
Huang Shaotian has to call me boss when he sees me.

00:24:05.160 --> 00:24:06.830
I will finish you after I finish my meal.

00:24:07.120 --> 00:24:07.700
Boss, boss.

00:24:09.080 --> 00:24:09.580
Boss.

00:24:09.580 --> 00:24:10.410
Check this out.

00:24:10.410 --> 00:24:11.660
A good chance to make money.

00:24:13.970 --> 00:24:16.310
<b>Three major guilds have joined force to put bounties on scrap-pickers!
Three major guilds have joined force to fight waste!</b>

00:24:17.370 --> 00:24:18.620
A bounty.

00:24:22.160 --> 00:24:23.830
This is real money we're talking about.

00:24:23.830 --> 00:24:24.950
Wow, that's impressive.

00:24:25.450 --> 00:24:27.410
The money is mine now.
